    },
    {
      "s": 5.28,
      "e": 6.43,
      "text": "- So when it comes to the TRAP force,"
    },
    {
      "s": 6.43,
      "e": 7.26,
      "text": "I'm an aircraft expert"
    },
    {
      "s": 7.26,
      "e": 10.23,
      "text": "^when it comes to firefighting and rescue procedures."
    },
    {
      "s": 10.23,
      "e": 11.91,
      "text": "^Basically what that's stating is that"
    },
    {
      "s": 11.91,
      "e": 14.25,
      "text": "^if we have a downed aircraft of any sort,"
    },
    {
      "s": 14.25,
      "e": 16.13,
      "text": "I have the capability of going up,"
    },
    {
      "s": 16.13,
      "e": 17.55,
      "text": "if we need to cut into that aircraft"
    },
    {
      "s": 17.55,
      "e": 19.16,
      "text": "to make entry for that pilot,"
    },
    {
      "s": 19.16,
      "e": 21.49,
      "text": "or if we need to deem that aircraft safe,"
    },
    {
      "s": 21.49,
      "e": 23.54,
      "text": "escort personnel within a dangerous area"
    },
    {
      "s": 23.54,
      "e": 25.04,
      "text": "of those aircraft."
    },
    {
      "s": 25.68,
      "e": 27.62,
      "text": "The training we do with these guys is great."
    },
    {
